{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，S09把X中“舍不得以前的生活，还是想在难受时有人陪”的开放性疑问，改成了“怕孤单到连那些气也肯再受”，对人物动机作了更强的预设，X在这里更准确、克制。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】直接标出每段心理变化的关键抓手，话与感受交替出现，加上感受词按音乐时点呈现，更容易让观众边听边抓住要点。尤其从怀念、自我劝阻、重新意识到孤独，到最终不再为了陪伴而放弃自我，Y的音乐细节与心理变化衔接得更具体，前后呼应也更清楚。X在少数地方保留了更完整的因果解释和开放的心理疑问，但整体观看体验不如Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "018ed9ae-42d7-4f3f-a8ca-5b5e80b00192", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T001408168129Z", "elapsed_seconds": 58.109, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:15:06.278515+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d670f06e52fa66471886f33e32c25328b638313b88634ef87f00cd4d281048dc", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3